---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const siteUrl = "https://akturesult.bond";
const pageUrl = `${siteUrl}/guides/aktu-result-not-showing`;

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      "@id": pageUrl,
      "url": pageUrl,
      "headline": "What to Do When Your AKTU Result is Not Showing (WH, INC, No Record Found)",
      "description": "Comprehensive troubleshooting guide for AKTU students whose semester results are withheld (WH), incomplete (INC), or showing no record found.",
      "datePublished": "2026-02-18T08:00:00+05:30",
      "dateModified": "2026-10-16T12:00:00+05:30",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "akturesult.bond Student Editorial Team"
      },
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "akturesult.bond",
        "url": siteUrl
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "@id": `${pageUrl}/#breadcrumb`,
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": siteUrl },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Guides", "item": `${siteUrl}/guides` },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "AKTU Result Not Showing", "item": pageUrl }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout 
  title="What to Do When AKTU Result is Not Showing (WH, INC, Errors) | akturesult.bond"
  description="Troubleshoot missing AKTU results. Step-by-step instructions for Withheld (WH), Incomplete (INC), and No Record Found statuses on OneView and ERP."
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <article class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-black light:bg-white text-gray-400 light:text-gray-600 text-left">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      
      <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-500 mb-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-blue transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <a href="/guides" class="hover:text-brand-blue transition-colors">Guides</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-gray-300 light:text-gray-800 font-semibold truncate">Result Not Showing</span>
      </nav>

      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-canvas-dark-border light:border-canvas-light-border pb-6 mb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-brand-blue font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
          <span>Troubleshooting Guide</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>7 min read</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Updated October 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white light:text-ink leading-tight">
          What to Do When Your AKTU Result is Not Showing
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-400 light:text-gray-600 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Stuck on "No Record Found", "Withheld (WH)", or "Incomplete (INC)" on AKTU OneView? Here is the exact cause for each status and the official steps to get your marks declared.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Mandatory Non-Affiliation Alert -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-200 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-10">
        <strong>Important Student Notice:</strong> akturesult.bond is an independent student utility platform and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or officially connected to Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University (AKTU). Resolution of withheld or incomplete marks requires official administrative action through your college or the AKTU ERP portal.
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
        
        <!-- Section 1 -->
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white light:text-ink">
            1. Understanding Missing Result Statuses
          </h2>
          <p>
            When semester results are declared, not every student's score sheet is uploaded simultaneously. The examination section flags specific cases with status acronyms:
          </p>
          
          <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-red-500/30 bg-red-500/10 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-mono font-bold text-red-400 text-sm">Status: WH (Withheld)</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-red-300 bg-red-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Action Required</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                Your result has been intentionally stopped by the university examination division. Common triggers include:
              </p>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-xs text-gray-400 space-y-1">
                <li><strong>College Dues or Document Shortage:</strong> Your affiliated college has not cleared affiliation formalities or university examination fees.</li>
                <li><strong>UFM (Unfair Means):</strong> An allegation was recorded at your examination center, referring your case to the university UFM disciplinary committee.</li>
                <li><strong>Attendance Deficit:</strong> Shortage below the mandatory 75% attendance threshold reported by the college.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-mono font-bold text-amber-400 text-sm">Status: INC (Incomplete)</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-amber-300 bg-amber-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">College Delay</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                Your written exam score is evaluated, but essential components are missing from the university central database:
              </p>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-xs text-gray-400 space-y-1">
                <li>Practical exam marks or external viva award sheets were not uploaded by the external examiner.</li>
                <li>Internal sessional marks (Class Test / Teacher Assessment) were delayed by your college department.</li>
                <li>OMR code or booklet serial number mismatch between the examination center attendance sheet and answer script.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-canvas-dark-border light:border-canvas-light-border bg-canvas-dark-surface/60 light:bg-canvas-light-surface/60 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-mono font-bold text-white light:text-ink text-sm">Status: "No Record Found"</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-gray-400 bg-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Phase Delay</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                The database does not match your query parameters. Usually occurs because your specific course or semester branch phase has not yet been processed by the university servers, or there is an input typo in your Roll Number.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2 -->
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white light:text-ink">
            2. Step-by-Step Resolution Roadmap
          </h2>
          <p>
            Follow this chronological procedure to track and rectify your missing result:
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-canvas-dark-border light:border-canvas-light-border bg-canvas-dark-tile light:bg-canvas-light-tile space-y-2">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white light:text-ink text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-blue/20 text-brand-blue flex items-center justify-center text-xs">1</span>
                Verify the Official Declaration Circular
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 light:text-gray-600">
                Visit <a href="https://aktu.ac.in/circulars.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-blue hover:underline">aktu.ac.in/circulars.html</a>. AKTU releases results in batches (e.g., final-year B.Tech first, followed by pre-final year, B.Pharm, MBA, etc.). Confirm whether the university has issued a formal notification specifically declaring results for your course, semester, and branch.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-canvas-dark-border light:border-canvas-light-border bg-canvas-dark-tile light:bg-canvas-light-tile space-y-2">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white light:text-ink text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-blue/20 text-brand-blue flex items-center justify-center text-xs">2</span>
                Contact Your College Examination Superintendent
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 light:text-gray-600">
                Immediately report the issue to your Head of Department (HOD) or college examination controller. If the delay is caused by missing sessional or practical marks, the college administration must submit a signed award list directly to the AKTU Controller of Examinations.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-canvas-dark-border light:border-canvas-light-border bg-canvas-dark-tile light:bg-canvas-light-tile space-y-2">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white light:text-ink text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-blue/20 text-brand-blue flex items-center justify-center text-xs">3</span>
                Lodge an Official Ticket on the AKTU Student Grievance Portal
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 light:text-gray-600">
                Log into your student dashboard at <a href="https://erp.aktu.ac.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-blue hover:underline font-semibold">erp.aktu.ac.in</a>. Navigate to the <strong>Student Grievance</strong> section, select "Examination / Result Not Showing", describe your query with roll number, admit card copy, and exam center details, and generate a tracking token.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-canvas-dark-border light:border-canvas-light-border bg-canvas-dark-tile light:bg-canvas-light-tile space-y-2">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white light:text-ink text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-blue/20 text-brand-blue flex items-center justify-center text-xs">4</span>
                Visit University Campus (For Urgent WH / UFM Cases)
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 light:text-gray-600">
                If your result remains withheld for more than 3 weeks and your career or higher education deadlines are at risk, visit the Student Care Cell at the AKTU Main Campus (Sector 11, Jankipuram Vistar, Lucknow). Bring an official letter signed by your college principal along with your admit card and photo ID.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3 -->
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white light:text-ink">
            3. Common Myths About Missing AKTU Results
          </h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-canvas-dark-border light:border-canvas-light-border bg-canvas-dark-surface/40 light:bg-canvas-light-surface/40">
              <strong class="text-red-400 block mb-1">Myth: "WH means I failed the exam."</strong>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400"><strong>Reality:</strong> WH simply means administrative hold. In most cases, once the college clears internal marks or paperwork, the actual marks are published without penalty.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-canvas-dark-border light:border-canvas-light-border bg-canvas-dark-surface/40 light:bg-canvas-light-surface/40">
              <strong class="text-red-400 block mb-1">Myth: "Third-party sites can unlock WH results."</strong>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400"><strong>Reality:</strong> Completely false. Only the AKTU central database administrator can release withheld results. Beware of fraudulent services promising to modify marks.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>

      <!-- Related Guides Footer -->
      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-canvas-dark-border light:border-canvas-light-border space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white light:text-ink">Related Guides</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
          <a href="/guides/common-portal-errors" class="p-3 rounded-xl border border-canvas-dark-border light:border-canvas-light-border bg-canvas-dark-tile light:bg-canvas-light-tile hover:border-brand-blue/30 text-white light:text-ink font-semibold flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>Common AKTU Portal Error Codes</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/guides/how-to-find-old-aktu-result" class="p-3 rounded-xl border border-canvas-dark-border light:border-canvas-light-border bg-canvas-dark-tile light:bg-canvas-light-tile hover:border-brand-blue/30 text-white light:text-ink font-semibold flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>How to Find Old AKTU Results</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
